{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01824","headline":"杂曲歌辞 古离别 · 张彪","name":"杂曲歌辞 古离别","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"离别无远近，事欢情亦悲。\n不闻车轮声，後会将何时。\n去日忘寄书，来日乖前期。\n纵知明当还，一夕千万思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张彪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01824.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01824","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}